      ],
      "year": 2025,
      "abstract": "\nThis essay responds to nine critics of The Shadow of God. They challenge the book\u2019s ideas in some areas but also seek to extend them. The essay welcomes particularly the discussion of whether the ideas of The Shadow of God can be extended to non-Western societies, the opportunity to explain more clearly what is meant by \u201cdiscursive transcendentalism\u201d, and the discussion of alternatives to personal immortality in an afterlife. At the same time, it defends The Shadow of God\u2019s criticisms of Hegel and does not accept that neglect of the alleged anti-Semitism to be found in German Idealism undermines the book\u2019s arguments.",
